CAVEATS / NOTES FOR DOWNSTREAM
------------------------------
- This is a dev shim around the system runtime, not a from-source build.
  The Z3 binary/library is the distro's libz3-4 4.13.3-1. If a later wave
  needs a Z3 newer than 4.13.3, rebuild from source (see Z3 source already
  fetched at /tmp/z3-src/z3-z3-4.13.4 and /tmp/z3-4133/z3-z3-4.13.3; full
  build via `python3 scripts/mk_make.py --prefix=... && make -j`).
- Cargo/z3-sys: build tasks should `source scripts/env/z3-env.sh` first, or
  rely on the .bashrc/.profile export, so z3-sys's pkg-config probe finds Z3.
